  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacities in the use of geospatial information for improved resilience in Asia-Pacific and Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to build climate resilience in Asia-Pacific and Africa (Bhutan, Lao PDR, Bangladesh, Fiji, Solomon Islands and Vanuatu in Asia- Pacific. Uganda and Nigeria in Africa). The project will enhance capacities in introducing technological advancement and providing integrated solutions for decision making in the fields of Disaster Risk Reduction (DRR), Climate Resilience, Environmental Preservation &amp; Food Security.</narrative>
  </description>
